WEBVTT

00:09.468 --> 00:09.849
Bye.

00:36.044 --> 00:41.146
I'm trying to find that boy I knew In shades of

00:41.226 --> 00:47.409
brilliant white and blue The one I thought he had

00:47.429 --> 00:53.851
it made Before the colors start to fade He's

00:53.891 --> 00:59.694
still in here, a distant ghost The one I miss and

00:59.794 --> 01:06.538
fear the most A part of me is lost, it's true A

01:06.598 --> 01:09.979
space that was reserved for you

01:13.913 --> 01:20.375
But the scars remain a map to trace And they found

01:20.575 --> 01:25.157
their proper place I'm standing on a different

01:25.277 --> 01:33.740
floor Than I was standing on before And I can hear

01:34.200 --> 01:40.482
a brand new sound This new and solid ground The

01:40.622 --> 01:46.024
echo of a worried flute A sound that stands as

01:46.284 --> 01:47.344
loving roots

02:09.142 --> 02:14.905
I'm learning how to trust again To let the gentle

02:15.125 --> 02:21.988
sunlight in I'm learning that a helping hand Can

02:22.108 --> 02:28.412
help a broken boy to stand I'm learning that a

02:28.552 --> 02:35.780
home can be A fortress built for only me By two

02:35.800 --> 02:41.669
strong women, brave and true Who know exactly

02:41.709 --> 02:49.440
what to do Cause the scars remain I'm out to trace

02:49.541 --> 02:54.187
and there I found the proper place I'm standing

02:54.528 --> 02:59.955
on a different floor than I was standing on

03:00.036 --> 03:09.126
before And I can hear a brand new sound On this new

03:09.347 --> 03:15.674
and solid ground The echo of a worried flute A

03:15.754 --> 03:18.236
sick disease with loving roots

03:32.217 --> 03:32.277
Oh,

